      "comment": "BLACKPOOL FINN (2) failed to come into contention last start at Traralgon, but prior to that won by one length at Traralgon (20.06) beating Hara Hachi Bu in a Grade 5 H on August 28. Consistent performer from this draw with a win and three minor placings to his credit. Should be very hard to beat this time. ASTON FONTAINE (4) led throughout to score two back then drifted back and missed the frame latest finishing a 6 length 6th at Warragul (23.46). Boasts a strong record from this draw with four wins and two minor placings from eight starts. Can measure up this time. BIG BOY PANTS (7) was strongly fancied last time but finished third (23.87), beaten 6 lengths. Can measure up. I'M TO BLAME (8) cannot be left out after placing last start.",
